name sam-emcon-react-1
timeout 200

# A CREW THAT REACTS TO ITS OWN DAMAGE — the third value of `set emcon`, and the ONLY cue for "we are
# under attack" this tree can honestly give a position. doc/air-to-ground.md §5.1.
#
# `react` behaves exactly as `free` and goes dark for ScootS the moment the position's OWN health
# register reports a new hit. Everything else was refused with its reason: the inbound anti-radiation
# round radiates NOTHING and there is no missile-warning channel, so a site that reacted to it would be
# reading the world; there is no acoustic and no seismic channel and inventing one would be inventing a
# sensor. What is left is a fact the position owns about itself, which a module may READ and no module
# may write.
#
# THE HONEST LIMIT, stated here rather than discovered later: the crew reacts AFTER the round arrives.
# A real crew goes off the air on a WARNING, and FlightBox has no warning to give them — so FlightBox's
# anti-radiation weapon is MORE lethal than history against an attentive crew and correctly lethal
# against an inattentive one.
#
# ONE Mk 82 comes down 60 m from the position: 1 586 J/m^2 against thresholds that degrade its radar at
# 900, its fire control at 1 000 and its structure at 1 200 but fail none of them until 2 000-2 800.
# The battery is HURT and STANDING — and it goes dark for its 45 s scoot because its own register said
# something changed.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log      `damage DAMAGE unit=sam` (a hit, not a kill), immediately followed by
#                   `site STATE ... from=SEARCH to=SCOOT why=damage` and `site GO_DARK why=damage`
#   telemetry_sam.csv  site_beam0 going 1 -> 0 at the burst and staying there for 45 s
#
# READING RULE: exit 0 = SUCCESS is the pass. The MEASUREMENT is the `site ... why=damage` pair
# — without `set emcon react` there is no such line in this tree at all, because nothing else can
# produce one.

unit viper
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.90000 6.80000  900 90.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set datalink off
  set fcr_mode off
  set store 3 mk82
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task attack
  set attack_mode ccip
  wp 46.90000 7.05000 900 450
  wp 46.95000 7.20000 3000 400
  objective survive

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.900539 7.050570 ground 90.0 0     # 60 m from the measured Mk-82 crossing
  set emcon react
  set scoot_s 45
  set rounds 0
